{"seq":1,"slug":"grammar-review","title":"高三英语 — 语法总复习","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/english/language-review/grammar-review","wordCount":1928,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"高三英语-语法总复习\">高三英语 — 语法总复习</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>高考英语语法不再以独立的语法选择题形式出现，而是融入到语法填空（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 分）、短文改错（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 分，部分省份）和写作中综合考查。语法填空是新高考的核心语法考查题型：在一篇 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>250</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">250</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">250</span></span></span></span></span> 词的短文中设置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 个空，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span></span> 空给出提示词（考查词形变化），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 空不给提示词（考查功能词填写）。高三语法总复习的目标不是&quot;从头学语法&quot;，而是将零散的语法知识串成体系，重点突破高考高频考点。</p>\n<p>语法填空的高频考点分布：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>考点</th>\n<th>出题频率</th>\n<th>题目特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>动词时态与语态</td>\n<td>每篇必考（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 空）</td>\n<td>给出动词原形，填正确时态/语态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非谓语动词</td>\n<td>每篇必考（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 空）</td>\n<td>填 doing/done/to do</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>词性转换</td>\n<td>每篇必考（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 空）</td>\n<td>名词↔形容词↔副词↔动词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>介词</td>\n<td>高频（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 空）</td>\n<td>无提示词，填介词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连词/从句引导词</td>\n<td>高频（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 空）</td>\n<td>无提示词，填 that/which/who/where 等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冠词</td>\n<td>中频（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 空）</td>\n<td>无提示词，填 a/an/the</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代词</td>\n<td>中频（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 空）</td>\n<td>无提示词或根据语境填代词</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-动词时态与语态\">一、动词时态与语态</h3><p>时态是语法填空的第一大考点。高考重点考查以下时态：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时态</th>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n<th>标志词</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一般现在时</td>\n<td>do/does</td>\n<td>客观事实、习惯性动作</td>\n<td>always, usually, every day</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一般过去时</td>\n<td>did</td>\n<td>过去某一时间的动作</td>\n<td>yesterday, last year, in 2020</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>现在完成时</td>\n<td>have/has done</td>\n<td>过去的动作对现在有影响</td>\n<td>since, for, already, yet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过去完成时</td>\n<td>had done</td>\n<td>&quot;过去的过去&quot;</td>\n<td>by the time, before, after（与过去时连用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>现在进行时</td>\n<td>am/is/are doing</td>\n<td>正在进行的动作</td>\n<td>now, at the moment, look!</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一般将来时</td>\n<td>will do / be going to do</td>\n<td>将来的动作或计划</td>\n<td>tomorrow, next week</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过去进行时</td>\n<td>was/were doing</td>\n<td>过去某时正在进行</td>\n<td>at that time, when（引导从句）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>被动语态</strong>：当主语是动作的承受者时使用被动语态。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>被动语态</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>be</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>过去分词</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{被动语态} = \\text{be} + \\text{过去分词}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">被动语态</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">be</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">过去分词</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时态</th>\n<th>被动形式</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一般现在时</td>\n<td>is/am/are done</td>\n<td>English is spoken worldwide.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一般过去时</td>\n<td>was/were done</td>\n<td>The bridge was built in 1990.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>现在完成时</td>\n<td>has/have been done</td>\n<td>The work has been completed.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一般将来时</td>\n<td>will be done</td>\n<td>A new school will be built next year.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>语法填空解题技巧</strong>：看空格处是否缺谓语。如果缺谓语，根据时间标志词和上下文确定时态，再判断主动还是被动。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-非谓语动词\">二、非谓语动词</h3><p>非谓语动词（doing/done/to do）是语法填空的第二大考点，也是考生最容易混淆的语法项。</p>\n<p><strong>三种非谓语形式的核心区别</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形式</th>\n<th>语法功能</th>\n<th>语义特征</th>\n<th>典型用法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>to do（不定式）</td>\n<td>目的、结果、主/宾/表</td>\n<td>将要做，目的是做</td>\n<td>I came to help you.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>doing（现在分词/动名词）</td>\n<td>主/宾/表/定/状</td>\n<td>正在做，主动</td>\n<td>The boy sitting there is Tom.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>done（过去分词）</td>\n<td>定/状/补</td>\n<td>已经做完，被动</td>\n<td>Attracted by the beauty, she stayed.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>非谓语做状语的选择</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>逻辑关系</th>\n<th>非谓语形式</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主语主动发出动作</td>\n<td>doing</td>\n<td>Walking along the street, I met an old friend.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主语被动承受动作</td>\n<td>done</td>\n<td>Seen from the hill, the village looks beautiful.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表示目的</td>\n<td>to do</td>\n<td>He went to the library to borrow some books.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>判断方法</strong>：找逻辑主语（通常是句子主语），判断主语与非谓语动词的关系是主动还是被动。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-定语从句\">三、定语从句</h3><p>定语从句是无提示词空格的高频考点。</p>\n<p><strong>关系代词/关系副词选择</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>先行词</th>\n<th>关系词</th>\n<th>在从句中的成分</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>人</td>\n<td>who/whom/that</td>\n<td>主语/宾语</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物</td>\n<td>which/that</td>\n<td>主语/宾语</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人/物</td>\n<td>whose</td>\n<td>定语</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间</td>\n<td>when</td>\n<td>时间状语</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地点</td>\n<td>where</td>\n<td>地点状语</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原因</td>\n<td>why</td>\n<td>原因状语</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>关键判断方法</strong>：将先行词代入从句中，看它在从句中做什么成分。</p>\n<p>例：This is the school ______ I studied for three years.</p>\n<p>将 &quot;the school&quot; 代入从句：I studied in the school for three years → school 做地点状语 → 填 where。</p>\n<p><strong>非限制性定语从句</strong>：用逗号隔开，不能用 that 引导。指代前面整个句子时用 which。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-名词性从句\">四、名词性从句</h3><p>名词性从句包括主语从句、宾语从句、表语从句和同位语从句。</p>\n<p><strong>引导词选择</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>引导词</th>\n<th>含义/功能</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>that</td>\n<td>无实义，引导陈述句</td>\n<td>I believe that he is honest.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>whether/if</td>\n<td>是否</td>\n<td>I wonder whether he will come.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>what</td>\n<td>……的东西/事情</td>\n<td>What he said surprised me.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>who/whom</td>\n<td>谁</td>\n<td>I don&#39;t know who did it.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>where</td>\n<td>在哪里</td>\n<td>Where we will go is still unknown.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>when</td>\n<td>什么时候</td>\n<td>When he will arrive hasn&#39;t been decided.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>why</td>\n<td>为什么</td>\n<td>The reason why he left is unclear.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>how</td>\n<td>如何</td>\n<td>How we solve this problem matters.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"五-词性转换\">五、词性转换</h3><p>语法填空中给出提示词的空格经常考查词性转换。</p>\n<p><strong>常见转换规则</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原词词性</th>\n<th>目标词性</th>\n<th>常见后缀</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>动词 → 名词</td>\n<td>名词</td>\n<td>-tion, -ment, -ness, -ance</td>\n<td>develop → development</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>形容词 → 名词</td>\n<td>名词</td>\n<td>-ness, -ty, -ity</td>\n<td>happy → happiness</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>名词 → 形容词</td>\n<td>形容词</td>\n<td>-ful, -less, -ous, -al</td>\n<td>beauty → beautiful</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>形容词 → 副词</td>\n<td>副词</td>\n<td>-ly</td>\n<td>careful → carefully</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动词 → 形容词</td>\n<td>形容词</td>\n<td>-ing, -ed, -ive, -able</td>\n<td>surprise → surprising/surprised</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>-ing 与 -ed 形容词的区别</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>-ing 形容词修饰&quot;令人……的&quot;（描述事物特征）：exciting, boring, amazing</li>\n<li>-ed 形容词修饰&quot;感到……的&quot;（描述人的感受）：excited, bored, amazed</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"六-语法填空的解题流程\">六、语法填空的解题流程</h3><p><strong>第一步：通读全文</strong>，把握文章大意和语境。</p>\n<p><strong>第二步：逐空分析</strong>，按以下决策树判断：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"空格处缺什么成分？&#10;├── 缺谓语 → 确定时态和语态 → 填动词的正确形式&#10;├── 不缺谓语但有动词提示 → 非谓语动词 (doing/done/to do)&#10;├── 给出名词/形容词/副词提示 → 词性转换&#10;├── 无提示词 + 连接两个句子 → 连词/从句引导词&#10;├── 无提示词 + 名词前 → 冠词 (a/an/the) 或形容词性物主代词&#10;└── 无提示词 + 动词/形容词后 → 介词\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>空格处缺什么成分？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 缺谓语 → 确定时态和语态 → 填动词的正确形式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 不缺谓语但有动词提示 → 非谓语动词 (doing/done/to do)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 给出名词/形容词/副词提示 → 词性转换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 无提示词 + 连接两个句子 → 连词/从句引导词</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 无提示词 + 名词前 → 冠词 (a/an/the) 或形容词性物主代词</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── 无提示词 + 动词/形容词后 → 介词</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>第三步：检查验证</strong>，将答案代入全文检查是否通顺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>完成以下语法填空（不看答案）：The house ______ (build) in 1920 is still in good condition. / She devoted herself to ______ (help) the poor. / It is ______ (importance) that we protect the environment.</li>\n<li>从近三年高考语法填空真题中，统计每种考点的出题频率，验证本文给出的频率分布是否准确。</li>\n<li>整理你最常犯的语法错误类型（时态？非谓语？从句引导词？），针对最突出的类型做 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 道专项练习。</li>\n<li>限时训练：在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟内完成一篇语法填空真题，然后逐空分析考查的知识点。</li>\n<li>用&quot;决策树&quot;方法分析一篇语法填空的每个空格，记录每一步的判断过程，形成自己的解题习惯。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>英语语法的系统性学习推荐 Raymond Murphy 的 English Grammar in Use 系列，其中高级版适合高三水平。</li>\n<li>高考语法填空的命题规律相对稳定，研究近五年真题的考点分布是最高效的备考方式。</li>\n<li>语法知识最终要通过大量阅读和写作内化为&quot;语感&quot;，单纯做语法题的效果是有限的。</li>\n<li>英语语法的核心是&quot;动词系统&quot;——时态、语态、非谓语、情态动词构成了英语语法的主干。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>高三语法总复习聚焦&quot;动词时态与语态、非谓语动词、从句引导词、词性转换&quot;四大核心考点，这四项占据语法填空 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">90\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90%</span></span></span></span></span> 以上的分值。时态判断依据时间标志词和上下文语境，非谓语选择看逻辑主语与动词的主被动关系，从句引导词看先行词在从句中的成分，词性转换看空格在句中的语法位置。解题流程遵循&quot;通读→分析→填写→验证&quot;四步，按决策树逐空判断。语法填空的目标是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟内完成，正确率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span> 以上。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高三英语 — 语法总复习","id":"高三英语-语法总复习"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、动词时态与语态","id":"一-动词时态与语态"},{"level":3,"text":"二、非谓语动词","id":"二-非谓语动词"},{"level":3,"text":"三、定语从句","id":"三-定语从句"},{"level":3,"text":"四、名词性从句","id":"四-名词性从句"},{"level":3,"text":"五、词性转换","id":"五-词性转换"},{"level":3,"text":"六、语法填空的解题流程","id":"六-语法填空的解题流程"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高三英语 — 读后续写","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/english/gaokao-skills/continuation-writing"},"next":{"title":"高三英语 — 词汇总复习","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/english/language-review/vocabulary-review"}}